1, "file": "images/1002.png"}, {"id": 1003, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 03", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 2440, "y": 2340, "scaleX": 1.0, "scaleY": 1.0, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1003.png"}, {"id": 1004, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 04", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 3580, "y": 2340, "scaleX": 1.0, "scaleY": 1.0, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1004.png"}, {"id": 1005, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 05", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 4720, "y": 2340, "scaleX": 1.0, "scaleY": 1.0, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1005.png"}, {"id": 1006, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 06", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 5860, "y": 2340, "scaleX": 1.0, "scaleY": 1.0, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1006.png"}, {"id": 1007, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 07", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 7000, "y": 2340, "scaleX": 1.0, "scaleY": 1.0, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1007.png"}, {"id": 1008, "name": "2026-11-14-skit-dji-design 08", "sourceUrl": "", "x": 8140, "y": 2340, "scaleX": 1.0, "scaleY": 1.0, "rotation": 0, "alpha": 1, "file": "images/1008.png"}], "strokes": [], "notes": [{"id": 2999, "x": 23020, "y": 300, "text": "From a skeleton with a bell to the Trash Witch 💀🔔\n\nBehind the scenes of a Clash of Clans character I worked on. It started in July 2025 as the Artificer, a \"shepherd of debris\": one of the Witch's kids who summons Constructs from the rubble of destroyed buildings. No magic? No problem, hit the debris hard enough.\n\nThen came a debris hammer, back to the bell, a turnaround and a 3D paintover, and a pivot into a Cleaner before it landed as the Rubble Knight and Trash Witch.\n\nSwipe to see the whole journey →\n\n#clashofclans #supercell #characterdesign #conceptart #gameart #processwork #sketches\n\nDrive folder: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1yWk7-c-nun3VscldZ6hiBKOB0QD0nCAA", "color": "#e9e6e2", "fontSize": 40}, {"id": 1999, "x": 9340, "y": 2340, "text": "How Skit & Dji were born 🛶\n\nThey took the longest to design of anyone in Megalith: doodles in 2022, a shortlist in June, views in August, the final concept in January 2023, then a comic-line redraw so they read well in small panels.\n\nWhich early version would you have picked?\n\nMegalith is a comic by Lizz Lunney (story) and Germán Reina (art). The full process is on Patreon: patreon.com/megalithislands\n\n#megalith #characterdesign #comicart #conceptart #processwork #sketchbook #indiecomics\n\nDrive folder: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EuWb-BCaXOrzRxfAl0hiB3VEN9SUvrWb", "color": "#e9e6e2", "fontSize": 40}], "shapes": [], "frames": [{"id": 2000, "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24580, "h": 1540, "name": "2026-11-14 · Ruin Witch (instagram carousel)", "titleSize": 140, "titleBase": 140, "level": "body", "font": "Inter", "weight": 600}, {"id": 1000, "x": 0, "y": 2040, "w": 10900, "h": 1810, "name": "2026-11-14 · Skit & Dji design (instagram carousel)", "titleSize": 140, "titleBase": 140, "level": "body", "font": "Inter", "weight": 600}], "palettes": [], "storyboards": [], "layout": {"pane": {"cx": 12290.0, "cy": 770.0, "zoom": 0.12, "maximized": false, "type": "board", "state": {}}}}, "driveImages": {"2001": "1uEvEbQ-igf_qA6202dQfJVO2U5GVD2cY", "2002": "1fCLcO0vJDYJLQERKSu_l2wMw9n-qRa1x", "2003": "1GIn7e3UH2bX4SAOc3uF3c4wrX7d9EHiw", "2004": "1EacPXk5Qewrpi455MPLyAWTGPJhp8exv", "2005": "1lnFQMBi6cI1RSIODFqtMv4AVYkezMjRH", "2006": "13r5_sbzwTDpb6-HKHDyljyhXcUXfGw4W", "2007": "11DLeXO8yFW2IXmEU0nycK16OZf_i3zR2", "2008": "13c388Tqb_bUIjNI5o8ZSU8MY3wytkBnA", "2009": "1QL9Wz_QBhO2zXjGEiA0_eGi-zxRPRnt1", "2010": "1vO90qTCRVEOqTXzABq2Tg_kyWBp-C0_3", "2011": "1Q11Z4Qm4ziw1V2ZD0cZDCC6bSoXg3iH4", "2012": "1Xziiv3LoyonNw0sDqqstlu_Suq0M72rY", "2013": "1fT2ULHath4GKe9votVyK4mmv4SQyl7cm", "2014": "1M3QlSjVChQHX-2fn7UUzDA1pOpTLvXIu", "2015": "1lSwvBqVQ2eLfbjjCs7-B4P172-xaRAdG", "2016": "1DEv9wCTv3icvlonhbW4X11nLh6ZyVMPK", "2017": "1-t6xUBXh7REoBRCT2OHPuH7d1bZGqqNO", "2018": "1yy0Q0Ca2daThne9tpj-dMYuID0FrMTnr", "2019": "1Olr6FPhkL-